{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far beyond the lands of the silly hoomans lies a brave and cunning village of penguins. As their ice melts, they begin to build a machine out of floating debris that is capable of opening hecking wormholes in space-time so they can one day migrate to a new, more better world. The machine can only be accessed by penguins small and slippery enough to fit down the tube...Once a penguin gets worm-holed, they'll need to explore the far reaches of the multiverse for a new home, then return to the arctic and psychically bridge the two worlds together with innate penguin  flipper brain telepathy. It's literally that simple. Many entities may not take too kindly to unauthorized wormhole travelling, but penguin snowballs are powerful. Just blast 'em right in the face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Penguin your way through 50  levels. A Berry Treacherous Mission Awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904670/extras/f43382d5946b42e732d9563fce9b9734.poster.avif?t=1767857001\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904670/extras/f43382d5946b42e732d9563fce9b9734.webm?t=1767857001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904670/extras/f43382d5946b42e732d9563fce9b9734.mp4?t=1767857001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Museum rules apply. Don't touch anything you're not supposed to!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin